Package: DuckGeneSnap
Type: Project
Title: Static DuckDB/Rduckhts GeneSnap-Style Browser App
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sounkou", "Toure", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Static browser-side genomics application that uses webR, DuckDB,
    Rduckhts, and Parquet assets to match uploaded genotype or VCF/BCF files
    against locus-first variant annotations without an application backend.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/sounkou-bioinfo/DuckGeneSnap,
    https://sounkou-bioinfo.github.io/DuckGeneSnap/
BugReports: https://github.com/sounkou-bioinfo/DuckGeneSnap/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Imports:
    DBI,
